    "setup": "No configuration change needed: the /api/ledger endpoint is already written with a synchronized block that serialises writes. Drive /api/ledger at 50 users. The default configuration (pool=20, threads=200) is already healthy for this endpoint -- the bottleneck is the in-process lock, not a tunable resource. Expect p99 proportional to 1/(throughput limit), not to any pool or thread setting.\n",
